 "script": "Clogged gutters? Easy. I've got a leaf blower.\n\nWhoa! Oh no. It's in my mouth.\n\nAbout one in sixty insured homes files a water damage or freezing claim every year.\n\nAnd an overflowing gutter dumps rain right at your foundation.\n\nHere's the real fix. Three steps.\n\nOne. Steady ladder, a scoop, and a bag for the gunk.\n\nTwo. Flush the downspout with a hose until it runs clear.\n\nThree. Extend the downspout four to six feet from the house. Cleaning every month? Look at gutter guards.\n\nIf Homie can handle it, so can you.",
